ineIndex` scans a whole source once. A known-ASCII `TextSpan` uses a newline-only scan;","+otherwise SSE2 or NEON finds newlines in ASCII blocks and scalar code indexes UTF-8 characters.","+It stores compact line starts and indexes only lines containing non-ASCII characters. Line views","+convert UTF-16 columns back to valid UTF-8 byte boundaries.","+Four-byte scalars occupy two UTF-16 columns, and a column inside the surrogate pair rounds down","+to the scalar's starting byte."," "," ### `SourceMap`"," ","@@ -318,5 +321,8 @@ Completed sources are `Send + Sync`. Lazy shared state uses `OnceLock`; `ConcatS"," synchronous. Parallelize at the module/asset level using Rspack's existing parallel abstractions,"," not inside one mapping stream."," ","-`ObjectPool` reuses large `Vec<usize>` buffers for UTF-16 indices. It uses `RefCell`, does not pool","-requests below 64 elements, and retains peak capacities. Keep one bounded pool per worker/thread.","+`LineIndex` owns source-wide line starts and keeps non-ASCII character offsets in a line-indexed","+vector of boxed slices. The vector stays empty when the entire source is ASCII.","+Offsets use `u32`, following Rspack's assumption that source files fit in 4 GiB.","+Mapping streams drop the index after use rather","+than retaining line-sized buffers in a pool."],"additions":22,"deletions":16,"truncated":false},{"path":"Cargo.lock","lines":["@@ -4913,7 +4913,6 @@ dependencies = [","  \"rspack_util\",","  \"rustc-hash\",","  \"sugar_path\",","- \"thread_local\",","  \"tracing\",","  \"url\","," ]","@@ -5220,7 +5219,6 @@ dependencies = [","  \"rspack_hash\",","  \"rspack_hook\",","  \"rspack_util\",","- \"thread_local\",","  \"tracing\","," ]"," ","@@ -5424,7 +5422,6 @@ dependencies = [","  \"rspack_plugin_json\",","  \"rspack_util\",","  \"rustc-hash\",","- \"thread_local\",","  \"tokio\",","  \"tracing\","," ]","@@ -5629,7 +5626,6 @@ dependencies = [","  \"swc_config\",","  \"swc_core\",","  \"swc_ecma_minifier\",","- \"thread